BrightCart Customer Support Knowledge Base

--- SHIPPING & DELIVERY ---

BrightCart offers three shipping options: Standard (5-7 business days, free on orders over $50, otherwise $4.99), Express (2-3 business days, $9.99 flat rate), and Overnight (next business day, $19.99 flat rate). Orders placed before 2 PM EST on business days ship the same day. We currently ship to all 50 US states and to Canada. International shipping outside North America is not yet available but is planned for next year.

Once your order ships, you will receive a tracking number via email within 24 hours. You can track your package directly on our website under "Order History" or through the carrier's website using the provided tracking number.

--- RETURNS & REFUNDS ---

Our return policy allows returns within 30 days of the delivery date for a full refund. Items must be unused, in their original packaging, and include all tags and accessories. To start a return, log into your account, go to "Order History," select the item, and click "Start a Return." We will email you a prepaid shipping label.

Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days after we receive the returned item, and the money is returned to your original payment method. Sale items marked "Final Sale" cannot be returned or exchanged. Gift cards are non-refundable.

If an item arrives damaged or defective, contact support within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the damage, and we will send a replacement at no extra cost or issue a full refund, your choice.

--- PAYMENT METHODS ---

We accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, PayPal, Apple Pay, and Google Pay. We do not accept cash on delivery or personal checks. Payment is charged at the time of order placement, not at shipping.

We also offer "BrightCart Installments," which lets customers split purchases over $100 into 4 interest-free payments over 6 weeks, powered by our partner Klarna.

--- ACCOUNT & MEMBERSHIP ---

Creating a BrightCart account is free and lets you track orders, save addresses, and access exclusive member discounts. BrightCart Plus is our paid membership tier at $59/year, which includes free 2-day shipping on all orders, early access to sales, and a members-only 10% discount on your birthday month.

To cancel BrightCart Plus, go to Account Settings > Membership > Cancel Membership. Cancellations take effect at the end of your current billing cycle; there are no partial refunds for unused time.

--- CUSTOMER SUPPORT HOURS ---

Our support team is available Monday through Friday, 9 AM to 6 PM EST, and Saturday 10 AM to 4 PM EST. We are closed on Sundays and major US holidays. You can reach us via live chat on our website, email at support@brightcart.example, or phone at 1-800-555-0199. Average live chat response time is under 3 minutes during business hours.

--- WARRANTY ---

Electronics purchased from BrightCart come with a standard 1-year manufacturer warranty covering defects in materials and workmanship. This warranty does not cover accidental damage, water damage, or normal wear and tear. Extended warranty plans (2-year and 3-year options) can be purchased at checkout for an additional fee, covering accidental damage as well.

--- PROMOTIONS & DISCOUNT CODES ---

Discount codes can be applied at checkout in the "Promo Code" field before payment. Only one discount code can be used per order, and codes cannot be combined with BrightCart Plus member discounts unless explicitly stated. Expired codes cannot be honored retroactively, even if the order was placed shortly after expiration.

--- PRIVACY & DATA ---

BrightCart does not sell customer data to third parties. Customer information is used only for order processing, shipping, and, if opted in, marketing emails. Customers can request full data deletion by emailing privacy@brightcart.example, and requests are processed within 30 days in compliance with applicable data protection laws.
